B68BD76/2B?e=.gif\" vheight=\" auto\" vwidth=\"45\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5U4fCRLN-anN7DMQ4rkolM7oRlanlMqVnlU8LzU8MRQkoRC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2LYhVMSyDM8UDnm7DnRG8LRLYMNLsUzfVUz-bUzn2MRVFUl-Do7W7M4QFLN-JQDTto4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aMRv0Mz9PLSbw62p8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=5811&e=.gif\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5LNLCiLmCbnmN8MQ498ozMkM4VkUzQqRUzMkLmTkMmlsMN-0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRLkyYL1yio7LDMm9iLl7ZMRNDnNn7LR-4LzlDUzUiMm6FLRVRM8MfnmMFMm-4M1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0LzG8MYyioR7PgtA8pUpcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=5811&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC02258C66851A8496FDD023156A4567/01C7CAF3/6236\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5L4lCPolLYMRNbMQmA7L8nVMlLZUzvqDozL4olCaLl7YU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYU1yiUShRL77ZnmNiL4Tfol-DMR-YUlCbL8rkL7rknzrFUmr2M4T2UzVFM4rRnSb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0LzG8MYyioR7PgtA8pUpcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=5811&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>4、填写学院意见，点击“保存并通过”，完成审核。</p><p> &nbsp;<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5n77C8M7nVnmG4MQ7L8UzQfnmWkU8Mq7Mm7iL7rRM4-snmN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSybUYhkoky8LzGPnllZUlM2MmT7MRNZol-YL8LPM8VVLlrFoRfkM7MfLlMFozQkL1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0LzG8MYyioR7PgtA8pUpcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=5811&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/99CB84101EE8ACF69D4989B23C17AE1E/80B4CA1C/96B2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5M4MC2oRvPM4vaLQ462LzUDMRNsUNCqZUNn2Mm7aM8C4nmv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhfn1ybU1h7UNr7ollDolrkU8L4Um9Dn7LiLlCZU4AkMlVFL8nkLzWVnRTFU4vYUYb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0LzG8MYyioR7PgtA8pUpcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=5811&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>5、学院推荐意见处盖学院学生科的章，校就业主管部门意见处盖各院所持有的中北大学就业管理与服务办公室的章。</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=5U4rC7MzGPnmfRUQmL4nmLsLlWRUNUq4MzLDLzMfoRQRLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyZUYhkoky4UzrRM7LZLR-iUz-sMmMRUzUinR9iU8U4nRAFolM7M474MNVFnmNDnSb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0LzG8MYyioR7PgtA8pUpcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=5811&e=.jpg"}